graph TD
    Req[Chat / Agent Request] --> Factory[ProviderFactory.get_provider]
    Factory --> CheckPref{Requested Provider Available?}
    CheckPref -->|Yes| RoutePref[Route to Selected Provider]
    CheckPref -->|No| CheckFallback{Fallback Enabled?}
    CheckFallback -->|Yes| TryAlt{Alternate Provider Available?}
    TryAlt -->|Yes| RouteAlt[Route to Alternate Provider with Warning]
    TryAlt -->|No| Error[Raise NoProviderAvailableError / HTTP 503]
    CheckFallback -->|No| Error
